      "id": "a1c0f6e2-0001-4c1a-9a01-000000000008",
      "name": "Respond to Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1320, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## COVE2E Claim Submission\nTriggered by the FastAPI backend after the Action Gate approves SUBMIT_CLAIM.\n\nSteps (in UI order):\n1. Preparing claim package\n2. Submitting claim to insurer (POST /mock-insurer/claims)\n3. Fetching insurer acknowledgement (GET /mock-insurer/claims/{external_claim_id})\n\nn8n only executes deterministic steps; all decisions are made by the backend.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420
      },
